\par
Mr. De La Vega presented the item. He said that the Village is utilizing the City of Houston contract that is the best price our Purchasing Department could fine. He said the budgeted amount is $250,000 annually. He noted that the unit cost is listed on page 19; bulk is 3,500 at $57 each for trash containers. \par
