\par
Ms. Cohen presented the item. She noted that the Village entered into a land swap agreement with this entity. She said this is at the corner of Pierson Road and South Shore. She said that the owners have agreed to convey a bridle path to the Village and pay us $200,000.00. They still have some due diligence work that they are trying to complete. They have asked to extend the due diligence to November 30th. \par
\par
}

